# With completed blocks hidden, Alt+j moves a task below the next visible task, so the move is visible.
# BUG: Alt+j swaps with the hidden done sibling, so nothing visibly changes while the file order does.
file <<END
Week:
	- Laundry @done(2026-10-01)
	- Groceries
	- Gym @done(2026-10-02)
	- Call mom
END
keys <C-o>
hide Gym
keys j <A-j>
see ▌   - Groceries
quit
saved <<END
Week:
	- Laundry @done(2026-10-01)
	- Gym @done(2026-10-02)
	- Call mom
	- Groceries
END
